<Slide style={{
    width: 1280,
    height: 720,
    background: '#FFFFFF',
    padding: '60px 60px',
    flexDirection: 'column',
    fontFamily: '"Arial", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif',
}}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 1.6 }}>
        STEP 5 / 7 · FOUR HYPOTHESES
    </Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C', lineHeight: 1.2, marginTop: 10 }}>
        Four hypotheses, falsified in advance
    </Text>
    <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#D6DCE5', marginTop: 14 }} />

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 16 }}>
        Written down before any model ran. Each row carries what we expect and what would count against it,
        so a wrong guess cannot be rephrased afterwards.
    </Text>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, marginTop: 14 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', paddingBottom: 8, borderBottom: '1px solid #D6DCE5' }}>
            <Text style={{ width: 84, fontSize: 12, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 1.2 }}>ID</Text>
            <Text style={{ width: 606, fontSize: 12, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 1.2 }}>
                WHAT WE EXPECTED
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ width: 470, fontSize: 12, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 1.2 }}>
                FALSIFIED IF
            </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '15px 0', borderBottom: '1px solid #E8EFF8' }}>
            <Text style={{ width: 84, fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>H1</Text>
            <Text style={{ width: 606, fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>
                Market probabilities are pulled toward the middle.
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ width: 470, fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>
                The calibration slope is ≤ 1.
            </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '15px 0', borderBottom: '1px solid #E8EFF8' }}>
            <Text style={{ width: 84, fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>H2</Text>
            <Text style={{ width: 606, fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>
                A transparent model does not reach the market, and the gap is not trivial.
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ width: 470, fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>
                The 95% interval puts some model ahead; or the 90% interval lies entirely inside ±0.02.
            </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '15px 0', borderBottom: '1px solid #E8EFF8' }}>
            <Text style={{ width: 84, fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>H3</Text>
            <Text style={{ width: 606, fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>
                The gap concentrates on promoted clubs and the first six rounds.
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ width: 470, fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>
                Either coefficient is not positive, or its interval covers zero.
            </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '15px 0' }}>
            <Text style={{ width: 84, fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>H4</Text>
            <Text style={{ width: 606, fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>
                The gap is information, not miscalibration.
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ width: 470, fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>
                Recalibrating the market closes more than 25% of the gap.
            </Text>
        </Box>

        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 10, lineHeight: 1.45 }}>
            H2 asks two questions on purpose: the 95% interval asks which way, the 90% interval asks how much.
        </Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ padding: '11px 20px', background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 6 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
            One of the four, H3, fails in one direction. By the rule printed above it drops to a description —
            it does not get rephrased into a success.
        </Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 9 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>DSC5001 · Statistical Machine Learning I</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>Team 32 · 6/10</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
